They wouldn't expect us
to attack them

577
00:45:31.750 --> 00:45:34.340
We've got nothing to lose
haven't we?

578
00:45:34.340 --> 00:45:37.340
Let's go in and
wipe them out

579
00:45:38.800 --> 00:45:39.970
