706
01:00:12.600 --> 01:00:16.440
I don't remember
the last time I ate like this!

707
01:00:17.060 --> 01:00:18.820
Nothing but vegetables!

708
01:00:18.860 --> 01:00:21.030
Where's my egg?

709
01:00:21.110 --> 01:00:22.780
So, do you like it?

710
01:00:22.860 --> 01:00:25.030
You know, Jin-tae is

711
