724
01:00:56.270 --> 01:00:59.610
That kind of face is
good for nothing practical

725
01:00:59.610 --> 01:01:02.730
He's nothing
compared to this

726
01:01:04.570 --> 01:01:06.240
Damn, what a knock out!

727
