I saw you looking
at her breasts!

730
01:01:15.160 --> 01:01:16.290
Give it to me

731
01:01:16.290 --> 01:01:19.540
My son'll be a General like
MacArthur someday

732
01:01:19.540 --> 01:01:22.130
I also have a wife in
the North

733
01:01:23.260 --> 01:01:24.800
- MacArthur!
- When'll this

734
