you wanted so much

747
01:02:14.470 --> 01:02:17.140
Just tell me
if you want more

748
01:02:18.770 --> 01:02:20.440
They will

749
01:02:20.600 --> 01:02:24.770
give me more
any time I tell them

750
01:02:28.490 --> 01:02:30.200
Yes, I drank a little

751
01:02:31.360 --> 01:02:33.120
Don't worry

752
01:02:33.280 --> 01:02:34.950
You'll be home soon

753
